  "goal": "Apply the Crinacle IEF Preference 2025 target: Crinacle's 2025 In-Ear Fidelity preference target: JM-1/IEF-style reference voicing with strong sub-bass weight and a relaxed treble shelf. For IEMs this follows the IEC 711 article parameters; for headphones use it as a preference direction, not literal compensation. Adapted to DITA Project M2: W-shaped single-DD tuning: well-extended, punchy bass with mid-bass emphasis; forward, emotional upper mids and vocals; smooth treble with extra sparkle near 10 kHz. Described as a 'neutral+' everyday IEM with natural coherence and musicality. Avoided Project M2's known harsh regions. Honored your preference: Correct the headphone's known tonal issues while keeping a natural balance.",
